@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@auth = Basic {{$dotenv DRAWIO_CLIENT_ID}}:{{$dotenv DRAWIO_CLIENT_SECRET}}
@chatId = demo1

# Paste the fileId from request 4's response here before running 6 onwards.
@fileId = 85d8e6ccf2374e2f80714fe359361691

### 1. Health — unauthenticated. Also reports whether the renderer is reachable.
GET {{host}}/health


### 2. The catalogue. Small on purpose (~2 KB): 30 libraries, ~4,000 shapes.
GET {{host}}/shapes
Authorization: {{auth}}


### 3. Search one library. `matches[].style` is READY TO PASTE — copy it verbatim into an
### mxCell's style attribute. Never assemble a style string yourself; draw.io addresses
### shapes five different ways and every one of those decisions is already made for you here.
GET {{host}}/shapes/aws4?q=lambda,s3,dynamodb
Authorization: {{auth}}


### 3b. Search every library at once, for when you know what you want but not where it lives.
GET {{host}}/shapes?q=firewall&limit=5
Authorization: {{auth}}


### 3c. A library that needs category qualification. Note the token: "compute/Virtual_Machine",
### not "Virtual_Machine" — the same slug appears in several azure2 categories.
GET {{host}}/shapes/azure2?q=virtual machine
Authorization: {{auth}}


### 4. Start a diagram. Returns a fileId; keep it for every later call.
POST {{host}}/diagram/create
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "name": "Order pipeline"
}


### 5. List this session's diagrams. Metadata only — the XML never comes back, because a tool
### result is pasted into the agent's context and an mxfile is a very long document.
GET {{host}}/diagram?chatId={{chatId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}


### 6. Validate and store. The validator runs first; the stored copy is replaced ONLY if it
### passes. Note the `&` in the label is escaped as &amp; — send it unescaped and it is
### repaired for you, and the repair is reported in `fixes`.
POST {{host}}/diagram/validate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "xml": "<mxfile><diagram id=\"p1\" name=\"Order pipeline\"><mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id=\"0\"/><mxCell id=\"1\" parent=\"0\"/><mxCell id=\"n1\" value=\"Customer\" style=\"shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.user;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"40\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"n2\" value=\"Orders &amp; Billing\" style=\"shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"240\" y=\"40\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e1\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"n1\" target=\"n2\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>"
}


### 6a. THE DEMO DIAGRAM: the service drawing its own flow.
### Everything below was produced by the workflow it depicts -- agent writes XML, service
### validates and stores, service renders. Run 4 first and paste the new fileId above, or
### reuse the one from 6; either way this replaces the stored copy and bumps the revision.
### Then run 8 to get the picture.
POST {{host}}/diagram/validate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "xml": "<mxfile host=\"app.diagrams.net\"><diagram id=\"systemflow\" name=\"System flow\"><mxGraphModel dx=\"1200\" dy=\"900\" grid=\"0\" pageWidth=\"1100\" pageHeight=\"780\"><root><mxCell id=\"0\"/><mxCell id=\"1\" parent=\"0\"/><mxCell id=\"title\" value=\"How a diagram gets made\" style=\"text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"60\" y=\"18\" width=\"980\" height=\"30\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"subtitle\" value=\"ServeAI's AI Agent, the Diagram Service, and the renderer behind it\" style=\"text;html=1;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"60\" y=\"46\" width=\"980\" height=\"20\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"hA\" value=\"AI Agent (ServeAI)\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"60\" y=\"82\" width=\"260\" height=\"42\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"hB\" value=\"Diagram Service\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"430\" y=\"82\" width=\"280\" height=\"42\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"hC\" value=\"Storage &amp; Renderer\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"820\" y=\"82\" width=\"220\" height=\"42\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"llA\" style=\"endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint x=\"190\" y=\"130\" as=\"sourcePoint\"/><mxPoint x=\"190\" y=\"700\" as=\"targetPoint\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id=\"llB\" style=\"endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint x=\"570\" y=\"130\" as=\"sourcePoint\"/><mxPoint x=\"570\" y=\"700\" as=\"targetPoint\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id=\"llC\" style=\"endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"><mxPoint x=\"930\" y=\"130\" as=\"sourcePoint\"/><mxPoint x=\"930\" y=\"700\" as=\"targetPoint\"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id=\"a1\" value=\"&lt;b&gt;1 · Start a diagram&lt;/b&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"90\" y=\"152\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"b1\" value=\"Seed a bare &amp;lt;mxfile&amp;gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"470\" y=\"152\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"c1\" value=\"{chatId}/{fileId}.xml&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;+ .json sidecar&lt;/font&gt;\" style=\"shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"840\" y=\"144\" width=\"180\" height=\"64\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e1\" value=\"POST /diagram/create\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"a1\" target=\"b1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e2\" value=\"write\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"b1\" target=\"c1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"a2\" value=\"&lt;b&gt;2 · Write the XML&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;styles from /api/shapes&lt;/font&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"90\" y=\"252\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"b2\" value=\"Validate &amp;amp; auto-repair\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"470\" y=\"252\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e3\" value=\"POST /diagram/validate\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"a2\" target=\"b2\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"d1\" value=\"valid?\" style=\"rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontStyle=1;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"500\" y=\"336\" width=\"140\" height=\"70\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e4\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"b2\" target=\"d1\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"c2\" value=\"Replace the stored copy\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"840\" y=\"347\" width=\"180\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e5\" value=\"yes\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#3a7d34;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"d1\" target=\"c2\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"a3\" value=\"400 invalid_xml&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;stored copy untouched&lt;/font&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"90\" y=\"347\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e6\" value=\"no\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#a02b28;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"d1\" target=\"a3\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"a4\" value=\"&lt;b&gt;3 · Ask for an image&lt;/b&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"90\" y=\"460\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"b4\" value=\"Read the stored copy\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"470\" y=\"460\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"c4\" value=\"Headless Chrome&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;draw-image-export2&lt;/font&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"840\" y=\"460\" width=\"180\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e7\" value=\"POST /diagram/render\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"a4\" target=\"b4\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e8\" value=\"embedXml=1\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"b4\" target=\"c4\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"b5\" value=\"base64 + mimeType\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"470\" y=\"570\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"a5\" value=\"&lt;b&gt;PNG delivered&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;reopens in draw.io, editable&lt;/font&gt;\" style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"90\" y=\"570\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e9\" value=\"PNG\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"c4\" target=\"b5\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"e10\" style=\"edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;\" edge=\"1\" parent=\"1\" source=\"b5\" target=\"a5\"><mxGeometry relative=\"1\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell><mxCell id=\"note\" value=\"The stored copy is only ever replaced by XML that has already passed validation, so a failed edit cannot destroy a diagram the user was happy with.\" style=\"text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;fontStyle=2;\" vertex=\"1\" parent=\"1\"><mxGeometry x=\"60\" y=\"650\" width=\"980\" height=\"20\" as=\"geometry\"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>"
}

### 7. A REJECTED document. Returns 400 and leaves the stored copy byte-identical — an attempt
### to improve a diagram can never destroy the version the user was happy with.
POST {{host}}/diagram/validate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "xml": "<mxfile><diagram><mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id=\"0\"</root>"
}


### 8. Render the stored copy to PNG. The PNG carries the diagram source in its metadata, so the
### image a user receives reopens in draw.io as a fully editable diagram.
POST {{host}}/diagram/render
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "format": "png",
  "scale": 2
}


### 9. Render every page into one PDF.
POST {{host}}/diagram/render
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "format": "pdf",
  "allPages": true
}


### 10. An unsupported format. Answered by THIS service with a message naming what is supported;
### the renderer's own reply is a bare "Unsupported Format!" that an agent cannot act on.
POST {{host}}/diagram/render
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "fileId": "{{fileId}}",
  "format": "svg"
}
